x flex-col justify-between gap-10 min-h-[300px] pt-8 pb-2 px-2 tablet:px-3 laptop:min-h-0 laptop:flex-row laptop:items-center laptop:gap-4 laptop:px-4"><a href="https://forecasttrader.interactivebrokers.com/en/home.php#signup" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex h-12 items-center"><img alt="Interactive Brokers Logo" loading="lazy" width="242" height="37" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto max-w-full" style="color:transparent" src="/interactive-brokers-black.svg"/></a><a href="https://robinhood.com/us/en/about/futures/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex h-12 items-center"><img alt="Robinhood Logo" loading="lazy" width="209" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto max-w-full" style="color:transparent" src="/RH_lockup.svg"/></a><a href="https://advantagefutures.com/open-an-account/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex h-12 items-center"><img alt="Advantage Futures Logo" loading="lazy" width="119" height="47" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto max-w-full" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Faf_logo_black-and-white.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Faf_logo_black-and-white.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Faf_logo_black-and-white.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75"/></a></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="w-full border-gray-200 border-t laptop:border-t-2 p-4 flex flex-col gap-4"><h4>How Forecast Contracts work</h4><p>Investors purchase contracts regarding economics, elections, capital markets, and climate. These contracts include yes-or-no answers to questions about predictions, such as: Will the US Federal Funds Target Rate be set above a certain rate at the FOMC meeting ending date?<!-- --> <a class="text-blue-light-600" href="/about/how-forecast-contracts-work">Learn more here.</a></p></div><div class="w-full border-gray-200 border-t p-4 flex flex-col gap-4"><h4>Membership application</h4><p>To obtain the Membership Application and initiate the application process, contact <a href="mailto:membership@forecastex.com" class="text-blue-light-600">membership@forecastex.com.</a></p></div></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></div><footer class="w-full text-white"><div class="bg-blue-dark-600"><div class="px-6 pt-6 pb-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto"><img alt="ForecastEx Logo" loading="lazy" width="1551" height="391" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[200px] h-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/footer-forecastex.svg"/><div class="grid grid-cols-1 tablet:grid-cols-4 gap-10 pt-4"><div class="tablet:col-span-2 justify-between flex flex-col gap-5 tablet:gap-0"><p class="caption">Trade the future with ForecastEx’s game-changing Forecast Contracts. Predict economic &amp; climate events, earn from accurate calls by answering “Yes” or “No.” It’s more than trading –<!-- --> <!-- -->it’s a long-term investment strategy, as there’s an opportunity to earn interest even when your prediction isn’t correct.</p><div class="flex flex-row gap-5"><a href="https://x.com/ForecastEx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img alt="X" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/x-white.svg"/></a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/forecastex" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img alt="LinkedIn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/lin-white.svg"/></a></div></div><div><nav class="flex flex-col gap-4"><a href="/contact">Contact</a><a href="/about">About</a><a href="/markets">Markets</a><a href="/insights">Insights</a><a href="/regulatory">Regulatory</a><a href="/members/fcms">Trade Forecast Contracts</a></nav></div><a href="mailto:info@forecastex.com" type="email">info@forecastex.com</a></div></div></div><div class="bg-blue-dark-700"><div class="px-6 py-3 max-w-7xl mx-auto pt-6 pb-8"><div class="flex flex-col tablet:flex-row tablet:justify-between"><p class="caption ">© ForecastEx, LLC 2026. All rights reserved.</p></div></div></div></footer></div><script src="/_next/static/chunks/0m9a_futco4l_.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[55672,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3cgxo_atf1a26.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/09dhlee9sg5d1.js\"],\"default\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3cgxo_atf1a26.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/09dhlee9sg5d1.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3cgxo_atf1a26.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/09dhlee9sg5d1.js\"],\"default\"]\n5:I[28129,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3cgxo_atf1a26.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/09dhlee9sg5d1.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[5500,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3cgxo_atf1a26.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/09dhlee9sg5d1.js\"],\"Image\"]\nd:I[68027,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3cgxo_atf1a26.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/09dhlee9sg5d1.js\"],\"default\",1]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/426p6bqxht6zo.css\",\"style\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/media/a66fc7b7dbc94114-s.p.36w3llbniq56r.woff2\",\"font\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\",\"type\":\"font/woff2\"}]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/media/dc6d2a64e9dbf3bc-s.p.3mjzw95c0-_52.woff2\",\"font\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\",\"type\":\"font/woff2\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"0:{\"P\":null,\"c\":[\"\",\"members\",\"fcms\"],\"q\":\"\",\"i\":false,\"f\":[[[\"\",{\"children\":[\"members\",{\"children\":[\"fcms\",{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__\",{}]}]}]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",16],[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/426p6bqxht6zo.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_ne